; Caulder, D4 "Claw, dread": the sketch D hook and gallop with a dark pad (A.26) underneath, a low horn answering in the gaps, and tom hits where the claps were. B minor, 124 bpm. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song caulder_d4
tempo 124
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst horn = A.111 shift=-12
inst pick = A.36 shift=24
inst kit = A.120
inst pad = A.26 shift=0
inst low = A.111 shift=-12
hit kick=36 rim=37 clap=39 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

track 1 inst=str vol=100 pan=-4 vel=116 gate=80 gain=1.178 
track 2 inst=horn vol=88 pan=12 vel=108 gate=88 gain=0.757 
track 3 inst=pick vol=100 pan=0 vel=116 gate=78 gain=1.178 
track 4 inst=kit vol=76 pan=0 vel=110 gate=100 gain=0.421 
track 5 inst=low vol=96 pan=-12 vel=112 gate=94 gain=0.926 
track 6 inst=pad vol=70 pan=-20 vel=96 gate=98 gain=0.505 

